    <content>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"a2f10005-1001-4000-b005-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"a2f10005-2001-4000-b005-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Favicon, sitemap, robots, responsive images, forms, error page"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Global Settings (CMS-driven)"},{"alias":"content","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"a2f10005-3001-4000-b005-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EGlobal Settings (CMS-driven)\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESeveral site behaviours are controlled by dedicated backoffice settings nodes rather than appsettings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESite Settings \u2014 favicon, logo, title suffix\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EPurpose\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFavicon.ico\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESite favicon (falls back to /favicon-default.ico)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELogo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESite logo media\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETitle Suffix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAppended to every page title as \u0022Page Title | Suffix\u0022\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/settings-site-settings.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Site Settings\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESitemap \u0026amp; Robots Settings\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EContent\u003C/strong\u003E: Raw robots.txt body (when empty, a default is generated)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgnored Document Types\u003C/strong\u003E: Doc-type aliases to exclude from sitemap.xml\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMax Sitemap Depth\u003C/strong\u003E: Limit how deep the sitemap crawls\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/settings-sitemap-robots.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Sitemap \u0026amp; Robots Settings\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EResponsive Image Settings\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETurn Off Responsive Image\u003C/strong\u003E: Master toggle (OFF = responsive ON)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtend Sizes SrcSet\u003C/strong\u003E: Extra widths (defaults: 1200/1024/768)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/settings-responsive-image.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Responsive Image Settings\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EContact Form \u0026amp; Cloudflare Turnstile\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Contact Form component renders a form from Simple Form Builder. Turnstile key resolution: field-level \u2192 appsettings fallback \u2192 not rendered.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/settings-contact-form-turnstile.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Contact Form \u0026amp; Turnstile\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EHidden Container URLs\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOrganisational nodes don\u0027t expose a public URL. HiddenUrlProvider suppresses URLs for built-in containers. Add custom ones via \u003Ccode\u003EuTPro:HiddenUrls:DocumentTypeAliases\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EError Page\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Page Error node provides 404/500 content with proper HTTP status codes.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/settings-error-page.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Error Page\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10005-3001-4000-b005-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"a2f10005-3001-4000-b005-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10005-4001-4000-b005-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"a2f10005-5001-4000-b005-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"a2f10005-1001-4000-b005-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null},{"contentKey":"a2f10005-2001-4000-b005-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10005-2001-4000-b005-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10005-5001-4000-b005-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"a2f10005-1001-4000-b005-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"a2f10005-4001-4000-b005-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="vi-VN"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"d1f20008-1001-4000-b008-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"d1f20008-2001-4000-b008-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Favicon, sitemap, robots, responsive images, form, error page"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"C\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t To\u00E0n c\u1EE5c (CMS)"},{"alias":"content","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"d1f20008-3001-4000-b008-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EC\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t To\u00E0n c\u1EE5c (CMS-driven)\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENhi\u1EC1u h\u00E0nh vi c\u1EE7a site \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n b\u1EDFi c\u00E1c node c\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t trong backoffice thay v\u00EC appsettings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESite Settings \u2014 favicon, logo, title suffix\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EM\u1EE5c \u0111\u00EDch\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFavicon.ico\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFavicon site (fallback /favicon-default.ico)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELogo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELogo site (media)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETitle Suffix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG\u1EAFn v\u00E0o m\u1ECDi page title d\u1EA1ng \u0022Ti\u00EAu \u0111\u1EC1 | Suffix\u0022\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESitemap \u0026amp; Robots Settings\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EContent\u003C/strong\u003E: N\u1ED9i dung robots.txt (khi tr\u1ED1ng, m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIgnored Document Types\u003C/strong\u003E: Doc-type aliases lo\u1EA1i kh\u1ECFi sitemap.xml\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMax Sitemap Depth\u003C/strong\u003E: Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED9 s\u00E2u sitemap\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EResponsive Image Settings\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETurn Off Responsive Image\u003C/strong\u003E: C\u00F4ng t\u1EAFc ch\u00EDnh (OFF = responsive ON)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtend Sizes SrcSet\u003C/strong\u003E: Chi\u1EC1u r\u1ED9ng th\u00EAm (m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh: 1200/1024/768)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EContact Form \u0026amp; Cloudflare Turnstile\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EComponent Contact Form render form t\u1EEB Simple Form Builder. Turnstile key: field-level \u2192 appsettings fallback \u2192 kh\u00F4ng render.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EHidden Container URLs\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EC\u00E1c node t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 URL c\u00F4ng khai. HiddenUrlProvider \u1EA9n URL cho built-in containers. Th\u00EAm t\u00F9y ch\u1EC9nh qua \u003Ccode\u003EuTPro:HiddenUrls:DocumentTypeAliases\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EError Page\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENode Page Error cung c\u1EA5p n\u1ED9i dung 404/500 v\u1EDBi HTTP status codes ch\u00EDnh x\u00E1c.\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20008-3001-4000-b008-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d1f20008-3001-4000-b008-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20008-4001-4000-b008-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20008-5001-4000-b008-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20008-1001-4000-b008-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null},{"contentKey":"d1f20008-2001-4000-b008-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20008-2001-4000-b008-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20008-5001-4000-b008-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20008-1001-4000-b008-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20008-4001-4000-b008-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
